OL,5,G1600 The World at War
OL,6,     FThe Desert: Laurence Olivier
OL,7,     Fnarrates this exhaustive account
OL,8,     Fof World War II. In the deserts of
OL,9,     FNorth Africa, the 8th Army battles
OL,10,     Fagainst Rommel's Afrika Korps.
OL,11,G1700 War Factories
OL,12,     FColt & Kalashnikov: Long before
OL,13,     FHenry Ford, Samuel Colt is the
OL,14,     Ftrue father of mass production.
OL,15,     FIronically, it was the inadequacy
OL,16,     Fof Soviet factory production which
OL,17,     Fmade the AK47 so effective.
